      "message": "Just noticed the following dependecy in built-in drm:\n```\ndrivers/gpu/drm/Makefile:drm-$(CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL) +\u003d ../../accel/drm_accel.o\ndrivers/gpu/drm/drm_drv.c:#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL)\ninclude/drm/drm_accel.h:#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL)\ninclude/drm/drm_accel.h:#endif /* IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL) */\n```\nso it looks like it cannot be enabled from the vendor. Please make sure that enabling CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL as built-in does not enable any additional module by default (I mean drivers from drivers/accel/ subtree):\n```\ndrivers/Makefile:obj-$(CONFIG_DRM_ACCEL)                +\u003d accel/\n```\nIf anything is enabled, please add proper `# is not set` to gki_defconfig.",
